{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/1420128-looking-for-a-specific-piece-of-art-in-a-book-which-one","id":1420128,"title":"Looking for a specific piece of art in a book... which one?","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-10-25T08:45:43-07:00","id":1420128,"title":"Looking for a specific piece of art in a book... which one?","content":"There's a specific piece of art I remember coming across in one of the newer books that I want to use as a visual aid in a game, but I can't for the life of me find it again. The art of it was a subway tunnel, with a horse-like mechanical ghost train coming out of the tunnel. <br /> I remember it was from one of the setting seeds, potentially a Tokyo setting seed? It was a ghost train with a crew of cultists around it. Can anyone help me find this piece of art? <br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2291-gwyn-chan-r-gwyll","name":"Gwyn chan 'r Gwyll","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"220"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-10-25T09:13:25-07:00","id":1420131,"title":"","content":"Page 266 in Mage 2e core.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/410713/Bloodlines-The-Ageless\" target=\"_blank\">Bloodlines: The Ageless</a> and <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/491569/Fire--Revolution-Carthians\" target=\"_blank\">Fire &amp; Revolution: Carthians</a> on STV<br /> Some other stuff I've done: Ordo Dracul Mysteries: <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1138490-idea-coil-of-owls?p=1140522\